      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "43 Cashel Avenue, Crumlin, Dublin 12\r\n\r\nDavid Ross Estate Agents, your local property experts, are delighted to present no.43 Cashel Avenue. This beautiful 2 bed property comes to the market sure to catch the eye of first time buyers or investors alike.\r\n\r\nSituated in the heart of Crumlin, number 43 is surrounded by a host of local amenities to include many shops, cafes, parks and sports facilities as well as the soon to be Crumlin Shopping Centre. Areas such as Sundrive and Rialto are also within a stones throw of the property.\r\n\r\nStarting with the ground floor, you have a modern and fully equipped kitchen to the front. Moving through the property you have a fantastic open living/dining room. With a mix of modern and contemporary styles this space makes for the perfect place to spend family time. This leads you to the rear of the property where you will find a large and private back garden which catches plenty of sunlight with its South East facing aspect.\r\n\r\nUpstairs briefly comprises two bedrooms, a double to the rear and a main master bedroom to the front. A fully tiled family bathroom completes the first floor of this magnificent property.\r\n\r\nCashel Avenue benefits from great public transport links with several bus routes running throughout the area. The M50 and N7 motorways are also only a short drive away which opens up access to the Greater Dublin Area and surrounding counties.\r\n\r\nGiven the condition of this property it will be very popular so early viewing would be recommended to see everything it has to offer.\r\nViewing by appointment only.\r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\n- Prime location\r\n- New combi boiler\r\n- Large back garden\r\n- Turn key condition\r\n- Off street parking"
      },
      {
